# K'Vort-Class Raider's 4+ striation, "Flying, menace, haste" with its 5/3 box (CR 721.2a-b): it is an artifact with no
# power or toughness below four charge counters (CR 721.2c, 208.3) and is a 5/3 flying, menacing, hasty artifact creature
# from four up. Sunset Saboteur (4 power, cast this turn) stations it to exactly four. It came under Bot1's control this
# turn and would be summoning sick (CR 302.6), but haste (CR 702.10a) is exactly what lifts that, so it may attack
# - and station taps "another" creature, so the Raider, an untapped creature now, cannot pay its own station cost.

[Bot1 Deck]
K'Vort-Class Raider
Sunset Saboteur
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

